  "content": "\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:36px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\">生物血条模组</span></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">此模组会在生物头顶添加一个血条。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>共有 <strong>13 种可自定义位置的栏样式</strong>可供选择。</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">按下 <strong>“H” 键</strong>即可打开选择器。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">血条的其他可更改选项包括：</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-<strong>渲染距离</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-<strong>缩放</strong>大小</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-<strong>名称显示</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-<strong>生命值显示</strong>（如果所选栏样式支持显示血量）。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-使血条 <strong>仅在</strong> <strong>生物处于</strong> <strong>攻击状态、受到伤害或您悬停在其上方时显示</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-纹理可见性</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-仅显示受伤的生物</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">-<strong>黑名单生物</strong>（在配置文件中设置）</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>-如果您使用的是 Forge：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">（在 <strong>blacklist&nbsp;=&nbsp;minecraft:cow,minecraft:pig&nbsp;</strong> 后输入，按此格式输入即可将这些生物加入黑名单）</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>-如果您使用的是 Fabric：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">（在 <strong>blacklist&nbsp;=&nbsp;cow,pig</strong> 后输入，按此格式输入即可将这些生物加入黑名单）</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">希望您喜欢。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">如果发现任何漏洞，请告诉我。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">感谢您下载本模组！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=71695030\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://c5.patreon.com/external/logo/become_a_patron_button.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"217\" height=\"51\"></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.net%252faff.php%253faff%253d320\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://jingames.net/dailymodder.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"316\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sR2IOE0VgXU?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>",
